        <detaileddescription>
<para>GetOperands fills a vector of material property matrices with the required values for later computation. These matrices always have the dimensions spatial-dimension^2 and they will hold either scalar, vector or tensor properties, depending on what kind of property the <ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_operand" kindref="compound">Operand</ref> is. <linebreak/>
</para>
<para>When the property is an element property, it will be put into the first vector entry MTRL[0]. Else, </para>
        </detaileddescription>
