      </memberdef>
    </sectiondef>
    <briefdescription>
<para>Known as: jacobian of element conductance matrix or K div^2 P. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="author"><para>S.K. Matthaei </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="author"><para>S. Roberts </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="date"><para>1999</para>
</simplesect>
PDE operator for the tangent stiffness matrix, using an upwind formulation. It differs from the usual <ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_upwind___integral__d_n_t__op__d_n__d_v" kindref="compound">Upwind_Integral_dNT_op_dN_dV</ref> in the test-function, since the placement in the global matrix is different. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
